    "shortDescription": "The Schiffli Embroidered Shirt Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 124 photographic views, tailored in Lightweight Flowing Rayon Georgette with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
