    "shortDescription": "The Draped Silk Cowl Neck Evening Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 131 photographic views, tailored in Pure Mulmul Cotton with Hand-Blocked Motifs with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Draped Silk Cowl Neck Evening Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 131 photographic views, tailored in Pure Mulmul Cotton with Hand-Blocked Motifs with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "description": "The Draped Silk Cowl Neck Evening Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 131 photographic views, tailored in Pure Mulmul Cotton with Hand-Blocked Motifs with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Draped Silk Cowl Neck Evening Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 131 photographic views, tailored in Pure Mulmul Cotton with Hand-Blocked Motifs with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.</p>",
