    "shortDescription": "The Silk Cape Kalidar Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 54 photographic views, tailored in Pure Chanderi Silk with Heavy Zari Embroidery with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Silk Cape Kalidar Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 54 photographic views, tailored in Pure Chanderi Silk with Heavy Zari Embroidery with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "description": "The Silk Cape Kalidar Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 54 photographic views, tailored in Pure Chanderi Silk with Heavy Zari Embroidery with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
