    "shortDescription": "The Velvet Sequin Gala Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 49 photographic views, tailored in Rich Modal Silk Blend with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
