    "shortDescription": "The Flared Raw Silk Festive Court Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 39 photographic views, tailored in Rich Modal Silk Blend with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Flared Raw Silk Festive Court Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 39 photographic views, tailored in Rich Modal Silk Blend with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "description": "The Flared Raw Silk Festive Court Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 39 photographic views, tailored in Rich Modal Silk Blend with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
