    "shortDescription": "The Chanderi Silk Gota Patti Floor-Length Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 49 photographic views, tailored in Lustrous Raw Silk with Micro Crepe Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Chanderi Silk Gota Patti Floor-Length Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 49 photographic views, tailored in Lustrous Raw Silk with Micro Crepe Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "description": "The Chanderi Silk Gota Patti Floor-Length Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 49 photographic views, tailored in Lustrous Raw Silk with Micro Crepe Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Chanderi Silk Gota Patti Floor-Length Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 49 photographic views, tailored in Lustrous Raw Silk with Micro Crepe Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.</p>",
