    "shortDescription": "The Chikankari Hand-Embroidered Regal Gown is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 39 photographic views, tailored in Fine Mulmul Cotton with Elaborate Gota Patti with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
