    "shortDescription": "The Chanderi Silk Pintuck Blouse is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 57 photographic views, tailored in Organic Slub Khadi Cotton with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
