    "shortDescription": "The Embroidered Kurta & Dupatta Set is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 47 photographic views, tailored in Fine Muslin with Delicate Thread Detailing with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
