    "shortDescription": "The Chikankari Kurta & Dupatta Set is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 39 photographic views, tailored in Pure Mulmul Cotton with Gota Patti Trim with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
