    "shortDescription": "The Chiffon Draped Kurta & Culottes Set is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 40 photographic views, tailored in Pure Chanderi Silk with Mulmul Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
