    "shortDescription": "The Handblock Kurti & Palazzo Set is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 51 photographic views, tailored in Pure Chanderi Silk with Mulmul Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
