    "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Tiered Georgette Maxi Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 53 photographic views, tailored in Lightweight Modal Satin Blend with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.</p>",
