    "shortDescription": "The High-Slit Draped Silk Resort Maxi Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 45 photographic views, tailored in Artisanal Georgette with Fluid Drape with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
