    "shortDescription": "The Printed Satin Crepe Belted Evening Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 68 photographic views, tailored in Pure Handloom Cotton with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Printed Satin Crepe Belted Evening Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 68 photographic views, tailored in Pure Handloom Cotton with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "description": "The Printed Satin Crepe Belted Evening Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 68 photographic views, tailored in Pure Handloom Cotton with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Printed Satin Crepe Belted Evening Kaftan is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 68 photographic views, tailored in Pure Handloom Cotton with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.</p>",
