    "shortDescription": "The Sleeveless Linen Umbrella Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 75 photographic views, tailored in Chanderi Silk with Full Soft Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
    "short_desc": "The Sleeveless Linen Umbrella Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 75 photographic views, tailored in Chanderi Silk with Full Soft Lining with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
