    "shortDescription": "The Mulmul Cotton Flared Umbrella Dress is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 83 photographic views, tailored in Lightweight Flowing Georgette with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
