    "shortDescription": "The Drop-Shoulder Boxy Tee is an export-grade silhouette handcrafted at Wastram's Jaipur atelier. Available in 29 photographic views, tailored in Breathable Slub Cotton Jersey with Pre-Shrunk Finish with precision anatomical grading across sizes S to XXL. Reinforced French seams, artisanal colour-fast finishing, and flexible wholesale MOQ for boutique supply.",
